# Three js ExamSys library

These file enable ExamSys to display different types of 3d image files.

obj.js - .obj file support
pdb.js - .pdb file support
ply.js - .ply fiel support
threeshared.js - common functions used by all file types.

The subdirectories container helper functions copied from the threejs examples:

controlers
##########

TrackballControls.js - allows users to manipulate the 3b object as if using a trackball.

changes:

- all console calls have been removed

loaders
#######
DDSLoader.js - allows dds files to be loaded onto a obj file
MTLLoader.js - allows mtl files to be read to help load material files onto an obj file
OBJLoader.js - allows obj files to be loaded
PDBLoader.js - allows pdb files to be loaded
PLYLoader.js - allows ply files to be loaded

changes:

- all console calls have been removed

renderers
#########

CSS2DRenderer.js - allows the rendering of css2 within a scene (used by pdb loader to render labels)

changes:

- all console calls have been removed